{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217740/extras/Gameplay_Gif.gif?t=1728998164\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On Kitty Survivors you play as members of a cat guild hired to protect the Kingdom of Catmere. Fight off hordes of cursed creatures in a land of magic, explosions and of course\u2026 KITTENS! Try to survive long enough to find yourself face to face with your greatest enemy, the great Dr. Walter Spray.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build you way to victory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose several combinations of perks and try to find the perfect one for you! You might want to give birth to a kitten that will aid you in battle or perhaps you want to get explosive diarrhea to obliterate your enemies. It's all up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Forge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wooden trunk, a dwarf beard and a muscular chinchilla, what do those things have in common? Well, in the wrong hands, nothing, but you\u2019re an experienced blacksmith that can use anything you want to forge the ultimate weapon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217740/extras/Forge_Gif.gif?t=1728998164\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can obtain eggs in your runs and hatch them to receive loyal companions. Use them in battle, feed them apples and watch them evolve into their ultimate form!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217740/extras/Evolution_Gif.gif?t=1728998164\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Auto and manual options for firing and aiming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Runs that can be done in 15 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique builds every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters with different skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pets with leveling system and evolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapon crafting, with over a thousand combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Six types of weapons: Bow, Staff, Boomerang, Minigun, Shotgun and Fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique and funny perks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elites and Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Permanent upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks for reaching this far! I'm a solo indie developer and I really appreciate your interest in my game! Defeat creatures, try different builds, have fun. Oh, and don\u2019t forget to share it with your friends! Anyway, thank you again and I hope you have a great day!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Too Easy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2217740/974fa09b8b342614e0b69c473ffcc73d60195fea.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2217740/21763f19d577a78b185835b65e72f2a4bcf22558.jpg"},{"name":"Thirsty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2217740/6c6eb3176384d4dafb730272eab29d50a3b64b99.jpg"},{"name":"Stomachache","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2217740/37c29ca3b6fc52457433d0854677a8d368ec04de.jpg"},{"name":"Forger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2217740/fd2e13db30e535423cc706c6f261229ea7df91c8.jpg"},{"name":"Which Came First?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2217740/2053d1cfedda42c0fe3f1855c9a8d7425b2412c0.jpg"},{"name":"Eat This Apple!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2217740/3fe0c623e26ef5926e8a202317308b804a409019.jpg"},{"name":"I Wanna Be The Very Best","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2217740/1a44669b1b421d2aa1646255c819b2547ab9f310.jpg"},{"name":"More Apples?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2217740/b002f19b60ecda58753c6fe4ed62bae3a999227d.jpg"},{"name":"Nice Underwear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2217740/3dc2b63eeaaef5127084546a40dd02f561856edb.jpg"}],"total":99},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2217740?t=1728998164","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2217740?t=1728998164","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1728998164","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217740/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1728998164","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217740/extras/Gameplay_Gif.gif?t=1728998164\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On Kitty Survivors you play as members of a cat guild hired to protect the Kingdom of Catmere. Fight off hordes of cursed creatures in a land of magic, explosions and of course\u2026 KITTENS! Try to survive long enough to find yourself face to face with your greatest enemy, the great Dr. Walter Spray.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build you way to victory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose several combinations of perks and try to find the perfect one for you! You might want to give birth to a kitten that will aid you in battle or perhaps you want to get explosive diarrhea to obliterate your enemies. It's all up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Forge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wooden trunk, a dwarf beard and a muscular chinchilla, what do those things have in common? Well, in the wrong hands, nothing, but you\u2019re an experienced blacksmith that can use anything you want to forge the ultimate weapon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217740/extras/Forge_Gif.gif?t=1728998164\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can obtain eggs in your runs and hatch them to receive loyal companions. Use them in battle, feed them apples and watch them evolve into their ultimate form!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217740/extras/Evolution_Gif.gif?t=1728998164\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Auto and manual options for firing and aiming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Runs that can be done in 15 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique builds every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters with different skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pets with leveling system and evolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapon crafting, with over a thousand combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Six types of weapons: Bow, Staff, Boomerang, Minigun, Shotgun and Fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique and funny perks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elites and Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Permanent upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks for reaching this far! I'm a solo indie developer and I really appreciate your interest in my game! Defeat creatures, try different builds, have fun. Oh, and don\u2019t forget to share it with your friends! Anyway, thank you again and I hope you have a great day!</p>","developers":["Little Horror Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217740/header.jpg?t=1728998164","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256989976,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256989976/movie480.mp4?t=1703087934","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256989976/movie_max.mp4?t=1703087934"},"name":"Kitty Survivors - 1.0 Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256989976/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1703087934","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256989976/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1703087934","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256989976/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1703087934"}},{"highlight":true,"id":256971638,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256971638/movie480.mp4?t=1695671305","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256971638/movie_max.mp4?t=1695671305"},"name":"Kitty Survivors - Action Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps