om of Catmere!","steam_appid":2217740,"support_info":{"email":"angelo@littlehorrorstudios.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Portuguese - Brazil, Thai, Japanese","type":"game","website":"https://bit.ly/KittyversePresskit"}